> On Friday 29 May 2009 03:56:58 tijlan wrote:
>> Is "broda" a distributive modifier in "lo brode jo'u lo brodi vu'o noi
>> broda"?
>
> I think what he meant is a semantic question, which can't be answered until a
> meaning is assigned to "broda".

Right.

> lu'o ki'o sfani .enai lo sfani cu tilju .iku'i lu'o ki'o lanme .e lo lanme cu blabi

Be careful with the scope of "lu'o" though. That's "lu'o (ki'o sfani
.enai lo sfani)"
and "lu'o (ki'o lanme .e lo lanme)".

You could have said "loi ki'o sfani", or "lu'o ki'o sfani lu'u".

